SUMMARY:Wheelhouse Wednesday Lecture Series: Freedom Needed A Harbor
DESCRIPTION:Please join us on Wednesday\, July 22nd from 6-7:30pm as we rechristen our monthly lecture series\, “Wheelhouse Wednesday.” Our guest for this inaugural lecture will be Darren Shelton\, Vice President at Moran Shipping and HMCM Board member\, presenting “Freedom Needed A Harbor: Celebrating 250 Years of American Freedom Through the Story of the Houston Ship Channel.” \nTickets are $5
URL:https://houstonmaritime.org/event/wheelhouse-wednesday-freedom-needed-a-harbor/
LOCATION:Houston Maritime Center & Museum\, 2940 Riverby Rd\, Suite 200\, Houston\, TX\, 77020\, United States
CATEGORIES:Lecture Series
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://houstonmaritime.org/wp-content/uploads/Wheelhouse-Wednesday-Darren-Shelton-1-2.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Houston Maritime Museum":MAILTO:info@houstonmaritime.org
END:VEVENT
